# Radiometric equivalent-thorium (eTh) color ramp — ppm eTh.
# gdaldem color-relief format: <value> <r> <g> <b> [<a>]
# Sequential yellow→red; transparent for nodata. Stops tuned for the
# NURE Bayesian eTh grid's typical CONUS range (~0-25 ppm, hot tail to
# ~40 over felsic / REE-bearing / heavy-mineral-placer terranes — Th
# tracks monazite + the alkaline / carbonatite REE story).

nv 0 0 0 0
  0 255 252 200 0
  2 255 252 200 170
  5 254 230 140 200
  9 254 200 90 215
 13 253 160 50 220
 18 240 110 30 225
 25 215 60 20 230
 40 150 10 30 240
